The function `EVP_set_default_properties()` does not seem to be working. I created the following test program:

````
#include <stdio.h>
#include <openssl/evp.h>

int main(void)
{
    EVP_MD *md;

    if (!EVP_set_default_properties(NULL, "provider=wibble"))
        printf("Failed to set default properties\n");

    md = EVP_MD_fetch(NULL, "SHA2-256", NULL);
    if (md == NULL)
        printf("Failed to fetch the digest\n");
    else
        printf("Succeeded fetching the digest\n");

    EVP_MD_free(md);

    return 0;
}

````

The output I received was "Succeeded fetching the digest". But I expected it to fail, because no implementations match the specified criteria.

I also note that `EVP_set_default_properties()` does not exist in the test suite - so we should fix that.
